{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant", "label": "ADR 0013: The brief is written inside the tenant; only the file leaves", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_forge_llms_brief", "label": "The brief is written by Forge LLMs in Atlassian's runtime", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "agent/SKILL.md needs a model and a third-party endpoint would put every issue title through a provider the customer has no relationship with, weekly. @forge/llm (GA July 2026) calls Atlassian-hosted Claude with no egress; declared as a module, a major version. Projecting titles away before prompting was rejected because inside Atlassian's runtime there is no crossing to protect and a brief without titles cannot say which work is stuck."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_refusals_not_passed_through_model", "label": "Refusal sentences are inserted verbatim, not passed through the model", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A model asked to write readable prose around 'too little completion history' will paraphrase it into something that sounds like a wide interval, which is exactly what ADR 0007 forbids."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_figure_substitution_check", "label": "Figures enter by substitution and prose is checked for foreign numerals", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A model given numbers restates them and a restatement is a second copy that can disagree. Prose that introduces a numeral the tools did not produce fails the check and the brief is not sent \u2014 ADR 0005's contract kept rather than bent."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_scheduled_trigger_no_user", "label": "A scheduled trigger runs with no user principal", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every panel read is api.asUser(), which is roadmap item 5 (permission mirroring) holding for free. A mailed brief read asApp() asserts every recipient may see every issue. So item 3 depends on item 5, which the roadmap did not say; the trigger initially refused rather than reach for asApp()."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_asapp_reversal", "label": "Superseded in part: the scheduled read takes asApp() deliberately", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "What changed is restrict: ADR 0014 put the send through Jira with restrict BROWSE, so who may receive is the platform's decision. Residual risk: restrict filters against the anchor issue, not the issues named. Authority is an explicit parameter defaulting to user; the recipient-editor permission check and the connection probe may never take 'app', asserted structurally."}, {"id": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_file_leaves_by_mail", "label": "The file leaves: mailing is the one boundary crossing (later closed by ADR 0014)", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Slack was rejected (an attachment nobody opens, becoming a link); letting the calculator build the file was rejected because clean_dataset() refuses free text and rendering there inverts the service's argument."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant", "target": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_forge_llms_brief", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant", "target": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_refusals_not_passed_through_model", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant", "target": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_figure_substitution_check", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant", "target": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_scheduled_trigger_no_user", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/0013-the-brief-is-written-inside-the-tenant.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant", "target": "docs_adr_0013_the_brief_is_written_inside_the_tenant_asapp_reversal", "relation": "references", "co